{"extract":"《良十世與兩樞機像》 是意大利文艺复兴全盛期大师拉斐尔的一幅画作。绘于1517年，收藏于佛罗伦萨乌菲兹美术馆。\n","originalImage":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/Portrait_of_Pope_Leo_X_and_his_cousins%2C_cardinals_Giulio_de%27_Medici_and_Luigi_de%27_Rossi_%28by_Raphael%29.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"}